class
   Pascal.Checks.Field

create
   Make

--  One field of a record type (issue #124), held by Pascal.Checks.Structure.
--
--  Offset and Width are in WORDS, the unit Types.Width answers in. A field of
--  a scalar type is one word, or two for a real; a field whose type is itself a
--  record or an array is as wide as that structure's Size.
--
--  Ty and Structure are the same pair as on Pascal.Checks.Binding, and mean the
--  same thing: Ty says WHAT KIND -- one of the four scalars, or
--  Types.Structured_Type -- and Structure says WHICH record or array, as an
--  index into Pascal.Checks.Type_Table, or 0 for a scalar. A field selection
--  resolves to exactly this pair, which is what lets the selection chain
--  continue through a nested record (issue #125).
--
--  Name is stored lower-cased, because Pascal is case-insensitive; compare it
--  with String.Equal rather than '=', which is reference equality inside a
--  generic in the Aqua VM (issue #60).
--
--  Every field of every record lives in ONE flat list on the root
--  Pascal.Checks.Scope, and Owner says which record it belongs to. A list per
--  record would read better, but a Linked_List whose element class holds
--  containers of its own corrupts the object holding it (see the note on
--  Pascal.Checks.Structure), so this class holds no containers and the
--  ownership is a field rather than a shape.
--
--  A flat list also handles nesting without index ranges: building a record
--  inside a record interleaves their fields, so "this record's fields" is not
--  a contiguous run and has to be a filter on Owner rather than a slice.

feature

   Make (Owner_Index     : Integer
         Field_Name      : String
         Field_Offset    : Integer
         Field_Width     : Integer
         Type_Code       : Integer
         Structure_Index : Integer)
      do
         Owner := Owner_Index
         Name := Field_Name.To_Lower
         Offset := Field_Offset
         Width := Field_Width
         Ty := Type_Code
         Structure := Structure_Index
      end

   Owner : Integer
      --  Index of the record this is a field of

   Name : String

   Offset : Integer
      --  Words from the start of the enclosing record

   Width : Integer
      --  Words this field occupies

   Ty : Integer

   Structure : Integer

end
